# Law of Demeter

Avoid train wrecks in business logic (`comment.getVideo().getChannel().getYoutubeId()`).

Prefer repository queries with JOIN FETCH or expose helpers on entities when multiple callers need the same hop.

Repository JPQL paths are fine.
